<title>ITALY: Olivetti to attempt to trade at 1455 GMT.</title>
<headline>Olivetti to attempt to trade at 1455 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new attempt to trade Olivetti shares on the Milan bourse will be made at 1455 GMT just before the stock exchange closes, the Milan Bourse Council said.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended on Wednesday after rebounding from record lows and triggered an automatic suspension after hitting a 10 percent trading limit.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
